# Wedding Invitation - Environment Variables

## Required

# Google Apps Script Web App URL for RSVP submissions
# Deploy your own Google Apps Script web app and paste the URL here
# See: /docs/google-apps-script-setup.md
NEXT_PUBLIC_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_SCRIPT_ID/exec

## Optional

# Wedding date for countdown (ISO format)
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEDDING_DATE=2026-03-31T14:00:00+08:00

# Couple names
NEXT_PUBLIC_COUPLE_NAME=Cindy & Keys

# Google Maps embed URL for venue
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPS_URL=https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Venue+Name&output=embed

# Background music URL (host your own audio file)
NEXT_PUBLIC_MUSIC_URL=/music/wedding-song.mp3
